`booktabs` tabular, 392 pt wide, set at `\footnotesize` (8 pt in the paper's class) inside the table itself (fits the 397 pt text width; shrink `p{4.2cm}` if the column width of the venue changes). Caption draft: **The acceptance rule specified before the runs, criterion by criterion.**
