## Placement widths
Figures are drawn at the width they are placed at, so type is 8 pt at 1:1. `fig5_tiers.pdf` is drawn for `width=0.9\linewidth` (354 pt x 228 pt) and `fig7_diagnostic.pdf` for `width=0.85\linewidth` (334 pt x 343 pt); every other figure is for `width=\linewidth`. Placing any of them at another width rescales its type (0.9 gives 7.2 pt, 0.85 gives 6.8 pt for a figure drawn at full width).
